4.X Approved Golden Sample (AS-MTG-001)

1. The Approved Golden Sample (AS-MTG-001) shall be used as the primary reference standard for visual and aesthetic inspection of all Multipurpose Military Grade Torches.

2. Prior to inspection, the inspector shall verify the Golden Sample identification number, revision status, approval date, and physical condition to ensure its validity for use.

3. The unit under inspection shall be compared directly with the Approved Golden Sample under specified inspection conditions (1000–1500 Lux illumination, 300–500 mm viewing distance, and 45° viewing angle).

4. All cosmetic attributes including surface finish, coating colour, texture, knurling, engraving, markings, lens clarity, and overall appearance shall conform to the Approved Golden Sample requirements.

5. Any product exhibiting a condition inferior to the Approved Golden Sample or any defect not represented by the Approved Golden Sample shall be classified as Non-Conforming Product (NCP) and submitted to Quality Assurance for disposition.
